MerkleAdapterDeallocate
├── when reconciling total assets
│   ├── it rejects a negative flow-adjusted NAV
│   └── it rejects a snapshot above the signed arithmetic range
├── when no liquidity has been released
│   ├── it returns zero even when NAV arithmetic overflows or the report is expired
│   ├── it skips an unavailable underlying balance read
│   └── it cannot bypass the delegator's final NAV validation
└── when liquidity has been released
    ├── it still rejects NAV arithmetic overflow
    ├── it pays released liquidity without another underlying balance read
    ├── it still rejects NAV arithmetic overflow when the requested return is zero
    └── it skips the cash read when the requested return is zero
